Package: CustomDerivative
Type: Package
Title: Extensible Derivative Pricing and Risk Analytics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amit Kumar", "Jha", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "jha.8@iitj.ac.in")
    )
Description: Tools for pricing and analysing financial derivatives under
    Black-Scholes and geometric Brownian motion assumptions. The package
    provides analytical European option prices, Monte Carlo pricing with
    antithetic and control variates, confidence intervals, finite-difference
    Greeks, and path simulation for path-dependent payoffs. The simulation
    interfaces accept user-defined payoff functions, enabling transparent
    construction of custom contracts while reporting numerical uncertainty.
